{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaayvurenda/life

    A little life on a staff screen: what goes well in its own subject, under three small pennants, summed and without
    names (local\life). Nothing without it. Each sentence carries its own keys, which no page uses, so that a missing one
    is never looked up in the page around it.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * life - lifelead, the words in bold, and lifeitems: lifetext and lifehref (empty for no link).

    Example context (json):
    {
        "life": {
            "lifelead": "What comes back",
            "lifeitems": [
                {"lifetext": "87 % of what came back this school year came back on time.", "lifehref": ""},
                {"lifetext": "46 books came back this week.", "lifehref": "https://example.org/local/oksigeniaayvurenda/late.php"}
            ]
        }
    }
}}
{{#life}}
<section class="ayv-life" aria-label="{{lifelead}}">
    <p class="ayv-life-lead"><span class="ayv-desk-moment-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>{{lifelead}}</p>
    <ul class="ayv-life-items">
        {{#lifeitems}}<li>{{#lifehref}}<a href="{{lifehref}}">{{lifetext}}</a>{{/lifehref}}{{^lifehref}}{{lifetext}}{{/lifehref}}</li>{{/lifeitems}}
    </ul>
</section>
{{/life}}
